{{Quote|Two identical hooks, made with the might of a beast. Use brutally.|Item}}
The '''Twin Hooks''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[sword]].

Despite its unusually low rarity for a [[Third Sea]] sword, Twin Hooks has some very powerful combos, namely due to {{Ability|X}} being able to extend of off moves it can 'latch' onto.

It does however, have comparatively low damage and slow moves when compared to other [[Swords]]. Even with it's slightly lower damage, it's still relatively decent for combos, and pairs well with [[Portal]] and [[Electric Claw]].

==Obtainment==
The Twin Hooks can be obtained after defeating [[Captain Elephant]], who is located at the [[Floating Turtle]] in the [[Third Sea]].

