==Overview==
<tabber>
|-|Pros=
{{Overview|Pros
|'''General'''
* Both moves have a quick start.
* Great damage.
* Nice attack speed.
* Both moves can hit [[Sea Beast]]s.
* Good for combos.
* Both moves have [[AoE]].
* Good alternative to the [[True Triple Katana]] and the [[Cursed Dual Katana]] due to its similar moveset.

|'''[Z] Sky Cyclone'''
* Good hitbox.
* Fast activation.
* Can drain [[Instinct]].

|'''[X] Prehistoric Punt'''
