|-|Cons=
{{Overview|Cons
|'''General'''
* Cannot hit [[Blade]] users.
* Hard to use.
* Both moves have short range.

|'''[Z] Sky Cyclone'''
* Does not "work" in areas with low ceilings, such as the boss room of the [[Cake Queen]], similiar to [[Lightning]] [X].
