==Trivia== 
* The X move on [[Mammoth]], True Prehistoric Punt, parallels the X move on Twin Hooks, Prehistoric Punt.
* The Twin Hooks has an unusually low rarity, since all [[Third Sea]] swords are at least {{Legendary}}.
* The Twin Hooks has the most mastery requirements needed to unlock all the moves out of any [[Uncommon]] [[Swords|Sword]].
* Despite not being one, the Twin Hooks is nevertheless classified as a [[Swords|Sword]].
* The Twin Hooks is the only {{Uncommon}} sword that can be obtained in the [[Third Sea]].
* {{Ability|X}} used to have the same sound as [[Dragon (Classic)]]'s Z Move.
* {{Ability|X}}'s startup looks similar to [[Rubber]]'s {{Ability|Rubber|F}}.
* Despite X move being able to grab a single player, it can deal damage to multiple targets on the second hit.
